# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Recipe in Git, pixels regenerable from a URL.
#  Default is EXCLUDE. The two register strips, the negative pole and
#  the text record inside the wave folders are opted back in at the
#  bottom. A file earns a place here if it changes how the work is
#  MADE, or if it is an anchor that must not move.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets — never, under any circumstance ────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.env.txt
env.txt
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*-key.json

# ── Drive junctions / shortcuts ─────────────────────────────────────
_drive/
_drive

# ── Bulk binaries: output, not recipe ──────────────────────────────
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.avif
*.webp
*.gif
*.bmp
*.psd
*.psb
*.ai
*.eps
*.tif
*.tiff
*.pdf
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm

# ── Regenerable artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
delivery/review*.html
delivery/gallery*.html
_contact-sheet*.png
_formats/
_model-ready/
references/register/_shots/
picks/

# ── Tooling / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  OPT BACK IN — the text record inside the wave folders, the register
#  strips and their readings, and the negative pole.
#  Git never descends into an excluded directory, so wave folders are
#  re-included before any negation below can fire.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
!.env.example
!evals/waves/**/
!evals/waves/**/*.md
!evals/waves/**/MANIFEST.jsonl
!evals/waves/**/qa_*.json
!evals/waves/**/picks*.json
!evals/waves/**/verdicts*.json
!evals/waves/**/mechanical.json
!evals/waves/**/report.json
!references/**/*.jpg
!references/**/*.png
!references/**/*.svg
!references/register/readings/*.json
!references/register/sources.json
!skill/assets/**
